#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: getting-started.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "GMail accounts must use &IMAP;. If you have enabled 2-step verification for your GMail account, you will have to get a verification code from Google as part of the initial account setup process. You will not have to perform 2-factor verification after the &kmail; account has been created, because Google marks your &IMAP; link as fully trusted."
msgstr ""

