#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: getting-started.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your account has now been set up, and you can click the <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> button to complete the wizard and close the window, or click the <guibutton>Details...</guibutton> button to review the account settings."
