#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "First, you should send yourself a message to test your configuration. To send a message, either hit <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>, select the <guiicon>New Message</guiicon> icon or select the <menuchoice><guimenu>Message</guimenu><guimenuitem>New Message...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item. The <link linkend=\"the-composer-window\">composer window</link> will appear. Fill in the <guilabel>To:</guilabel> field with your email address and type something in the <guilabel>Subject</guilabel> field. Send the message by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Message</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Send</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
